description.day:
Every {modes_singular} running in {place} on an average {month} weekday, from the morning rush to the next morning, in {seconds} seconds.

I took the {month} {year} timetables, kept the trips that run on at least half of the weekdays, and put each vehicle where its schedule says it is. The count is the average for that minute and only includes vehicles inside the {place} city limits. The faded ones are just outside.

Busiest moment: {peak_count} vehicles at {peak_time}.
{dates_sentence}

