description.rush:
The morning rush in {place}, 6:30 to 9:30 am, slowed down to {seconds} seconds. Every {modes_singular} inside the city on an average {month} weekday.

The timetables are from {month} {year}. I kept the trips that run on at least half of the weekdays and placed each vehicle by its schedule. Vehicles outside the {place} city limits are faded and not counted.

Busiest moment of the morning: {peak_count} vehicles at {peak_time}.
{dates_sentence}

