description.week:
A week of every {modes_singular} in {place}, Monday to Sunday, in {seconds} seconds.

Each day is the average of that weekday in {month} {year}, so Saturday is a typical Saturday, not one particular one. Vehicles outside the {place} city limits are faded and not counted.

Busiest moment: {peak_count} vehicles, {peak_day} at {peak_time}.
{dates_sentence}

